{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالسَّمَاءِ","d":"wal-samāi","e":"By the sky"},{"c":"وَالطَّارِقِ","d":"wal-ṭāriqi","e":"and the night comer"}],"a":{"g":"By the sky and the night comer -"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"can make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"الطَّارِقُ","d":"l-ṭāriqu","e":"the night comer (is)"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"النَّجْمُ","d":"al-najmu","e":"(It is) the star"},{"c":"الثَّاقِبُ","d":"l-thāqibu","e":"the piercing!"}],"a":{"g":"It is the piercing star -"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"(is) every"},{"c":"نَفْسٍ","d":"nafsin","e":"soul"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"but"},{"c":"عَلَيْهَا","d":"ʿalayhā","e":"over it"},{"c":"حَافِظٌ","d":"ḥāfiẓun","e":"(is) a protector"}],"a":{"g":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَلْيَنْظُرِ","d":"falyanẓuri","e":"So let see"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man"},{"c":"مِمَّ","d":"mimma","e":"from what"},{"c":"خُلِقَ","d":"khuliqa","e":"he is created"}],"a":{"g":"So let man observe from what he was created."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"خُلِقَ","d":"khuliqa","e":"He is created"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَاءٍ","d":"māin","e":"a water"},{"c":"دَافِقٍ","d":"dāfiqin","e":"ejected"}],"a":{"g":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"يَخْرُجُ","d":"yakhruju","e":"Coming forth"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"بَيْنِ","d":"bayni","e":"between"},{"c":"الصُّلْبِ","d":"l-ṣul'bi","e":"the backbone"},{"c":"وَالتَّرَائِبِ","d":"wal-tarāibi","e":"and the ribs"}],"a":{"g":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَجْعِهِ","d":"rajʿihi","e":"return him"},{"c":"لَقَادِرٌ","d":"laqādirun","e":"(is) Able"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"تُبْلَى","d":"tub'lā","e":"will be tested"},{"c":"السَّرَائِرُ","d":"l-sarāiru","e":"the secrets"}],"a":{"g":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"Then not"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"(is) for him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"قُوَّةٍ","d":"quwwatin","e":"power"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"نَاصِرٍ","d":"nāṣirin","e":"any helper"}],"a":{"g":"Then man will have no power or any helper."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَالسَّمَاءِ","d":"wal-samāi","e":"By the sky"},{"c":"ذَاتِ","d":"dhāti","e":"which"},{"c":"الرَّجْعِ","d":"l-rajʿi","e":"returns"}],"a":{"g":"By the sky which returns [rain]"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"And the earth"},{"c":"ذَاتِ","d":"dhāti","e":"which"},{"c":"الصَّدْعِ","d":"l-ṣadʿi","e":"cracks open"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the earth which cracks open,"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed it"},{"c":"لَقَوْلٌ","d":"laqawlun","e":"(is) surely a Word"},{"c":"فَصْلٌ","d":"faṣlun","e":"decisive"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement,"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it"},{"c":"بِالْهَزْلِ","d":"bil-hazli","e":"(is) for amusement"}],"a":{"g":"And it is not amusement."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed they"},{"c":"يَكِيدُونَ","d":"yakīdūna","e":"are plotting"},{"c":"كَيْدًا","d":"kaydan","e":"a plot"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَكِيدُ","d":"wa-akīdu","e":"But I am planning"},{"c":"كَيْدًا","d":"kaydan","e":"a plan"}],"a":{"g":"But I am planning a plan."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَهِّلِ","d":"famahhili","e":"So give respite"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"(to) the disbelievers"},{"c":"أَمْهِلْهُمْ","d":"amhil'hum","e":"Give respite to them"},{"c":"رُوَيْدًا","d":"ruwaydan","e":"little"}],"a":{"g":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile."}}}